AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0002586> "p results in breakdown of c if and only if the execution of p leads to c no longer being present at the end of p")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0002586> "results in breakdown of")
SubObjectPropertyOf(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0002586> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0002233>)

