AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CHEBI_23357> "An organic molecule or ion (usually a metal ion) that is required by an enzyme for its activity. It may be attached either loosely (coenzyme) or tightly (prosthetic group).")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CHEBI_23357> "cofactor")
SubClassOf(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CHEBI_23357> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CHEBI_52206>)

